  "summary": "The CGT-120 talks to a BMS through a BACnet BMS kit: a Modbus control in the heater feeds a pre-configured FieldServer ProtoAir gateway. The gateway publishes a short list of status, temperature, firing-rate, ignition counter and lockout/blocking-history objects plus one setpoint write object. The protocol selector on the gateway picks BACnet IP or BACnet MS/TP.",
