  "notes": [
    "The points list has no read/write column. AV 37 'Store DHW SP WR' is listed as writable from its name; the rest are listed read-only.",
    "Status (AI 4) codes come from Appendix B; Error Code and the lockout/blocking history objects use the code list in Appendix C (A.. lockouts, E.. blocking errors).",
    "Temperatures follow the unit flag in AI 1 (°C or °F).",
    "The manual's description column for AI 16 says 'Integer, resolution of 16'.",
    "Firing Rate reports combustion blower speed; a rate above 0 % with 0 µA flame current means pre- or post-purge."
