    "summary": "Wire the BMS kit's Modbus control to the heater, set the FieldServer protocol selector (1 = BACnet IP, 2 = BACnet MS/TP, 3 = BACnet MS/TP single node) and run Discovery so it builds a profile for each heater. Then read status, top tank temperature, firing rate and error code, and write the storage setpoint through AV 37.",
