    "setup": [
      "FieldServer protocol selector: 1 = BACnet IP/Modbus TCP, 2 = BACnet MS/TP, 3 = BACnet MS/TP (single node); submit, then System Restart.",
      "Set up the gateway from a laptop over its Wi-Fi access point (default 192.168.50.1) or with the FieldServer Toolbox; the login password is printed on the gateway label.",
      "Use Discovery Mode to add an active profile for each heater (takes about five minutes).",
      "Switch S4 on the heater main control must be in the left position (towards J18)."
